diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..9d1d7a1
--- /dev/null
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+eduka-orca (50.3+eduka1) trixie; urgency=medium
+
+  * First Eduka-Orca release for Edukasaun OS, based on Orca 50.3.
+  * Slower default speech (rate 30) and slightly lower pitch (4.5) for
+    users who are hard of hearing.
+  * On-screen captions (speech monitor) on by default: 24 pt yellow on
+    black, docked at the bottom of the screen, does not steal focus,
+    newest line in bold; setting persisted in GSettings.
+  * Tetum locale uses a European Portuguese voice.
+  * Eduka-Desktop (LXQt) integration: autostart helper, Qt accessibility
+    environment, "Eduka-Orca" menu entry, on/off toggle with notification,
+    Super+Alt+S shortcut snippet.
+  * Rate, pitch, volume and caption settings honour GSettings vendor
+    overrides so schools can tune them system-wide.
+
+ -- Edukasaun OS <hugomonizdorego@angelinojoana.com>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:00:00 +0900
